	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nky_AKHattymSHm3j",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 28, DX 9, IQ 4, HT 12, HP 28, WILL 8, PER 8, FP 12, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 7, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nZKzp7bZ2sQEsSU_y",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 32 (offense 14, protection 18), threat tier standard, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "noe0iXhvJ-yQcmowI",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/heavy-horse.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nHh71CVUjLmZZIhOZ",
			"text": "Independent build total: -50 points of racial traits plus 2 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nKteoKvl62IcDBZKp",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Draft Horse (SRD 5.1); Horse, Heavy (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nPX87YzjGrcuzKZe_",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nF4DqD8n0qmAX1XFR",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5, 7 at a sprint (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "ny-BYDtBXHYQum9I5",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nx0_UzTi7BCMQG11K",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
